	(text_box "The card continues the main-board WS2812B chain: RGB_DIN is the 5 V data\noutput of the last main-board LED, so these are LEDs 8..11 of that chain.\nAll four are driven by the MCU."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 104.14 0)
		(size 106.68 10.16)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.254)
			(type solid)
			(color 72 72 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 194 194 0 0.5)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3a55570e-b39f-59a2-aa33-c7a1259fb394")
	)
	(text_box "24AA025E48 at I2C address 0x50: factory EUI-48 plus 128 bytes\nfor a card type / revision record.\nSupplied from 3V3_ID (main-board 3V3 through 220R, card pin 6), so the\nmain board can identify the card before it switches EXP_5V0 on.\nI2C pull-ups are on the main board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 149.86 0)
		(size 106.68 13.97)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.254)
			(type solid)
			(color 72 72 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 194 194 0 0.5)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b34b28f7-6e5d-53c3-9708-b5b57ee8e7ce")
	)
	(text_box "3V3 load: LAN9252 up to about 250 mA\nwith both links up. LDO loss ~0.45 W:\ngive its thermal pad copper and vias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
